<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" %><!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Our Story | GreenBasket</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/assets/css/greenbasket.css"></head><body><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/includes/header.jspf" %><main class="page-shell"><div class="container"><div class="page-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our story</span><h1 style="margin-top:14px">Organic should feel simple, local and trustworthy.</h1><p>GreenBasket brings buyers and organic farmers into one focused marketplace with clear product information and direct farm identity.</p></div><div class="info-grid"><article class="info-card"><h3>Why we exist</h3><p>Finding genuine organic produce can feel fragmented. GreenBasket creates one organized place where customers can discover organic products and the people who grow them.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h3>What we value</h3><p>Trust, transparency, local livelihoods and responsible farming shape the experience—from farmer verification to product discovery.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h3>For buyers</h3><p>A clean catalog, meaningful categories, product details, cart, checkout and order history in one consistent experience.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h3>For farmers</h3><p>A dedicated seller studio for profile management, verification, product listing and visibility to customers seeking organic food.</p></article></div></div></main><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/includes/footer.jspf" %></body></html>
